{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>THE DEMO IS A STANDALONE EXPERIENCE SET 6 MONTHS BEFORE THE EVENTS OF THE FULL GAME</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/6247e5507664012d279624ff4d765774.poster.avif?t=1774039908\" width=798 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/6247e5507664012d279624ff4d765774.webm?t=1774039908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/6247e5507664012d279624ff4d765774.mp4?t=1774039908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paragnosia: Museum</strong> blends <strong>anomaly-spotting</strong> with tense <strong>camera-observation</strong> gameplay. You play as Esther Mason, an exorcist dispatched by the Cam-on-Rail Company. <strong>Your mission: monitor the museum throughout the night and neutralise any paranormal activity before it\u2019s too late.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/9659fdad7b4c9d4cde0adc0451a115b2.poster.avif?t=1774039908\" width=798 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/9659fdad7b4c9d4cde0adc0451a115b2.webm?t=1774039908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/extras/9659fdad7b4c9d4cde0adc0451a115b2.mp4?t=1774039908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY FOCUSED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hour brings new <strong>supernatural changes</strong>, from the obvious to the very subtle. <strong>Observe carefully</strong>, compare, and identify newly appearing anomalies. At the end of every round, the system reveals how many you missed. <strong>Remember: the devil is in the details, and some anomalies can only be seen from very specific angles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY ALIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each missed anomaly breaks one of the six locks protecting you from the evil within.</strong> Lose them all before 8:00 AM, and whatever haunts the museum will come at you. To survive and banish this entity, your vigilance is your only weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tick tock, the clock\u2019s ticking\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY VIGILANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spirits require precise actions at specific moments to be exorcised. Sharpen your observation skills, adapt your strategy, and prepare to face a terrifying anima. <strong>With up to 130 anomalies to uncover, completionists will have their work cut out for them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Duskheath Museum, a disturbing exhibition dedicated to the occult and communication with the dead. Explore ancient Egypt, pre-Columbian civilizations, cursed artifacts, funeral relics, and countless other mysterious objects steeped in dark history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or become part of the exhibit?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DURATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45-200 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.