ag\" ><strong>STAY VIGILANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spirits require precise actions at specific moments to be exorcised. Sharpen your observation skills, adapt your strategy, and prepare to face a terrifying anima. <strong>With up to 130 anomalies to uncover, completionists will have their work cut out for them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place in the Duskheath Museum, a disturbing exhibition dedicated to the occult and communication with the dead. Explore ancient Egypt, pre-Columbian civilizations, cursed artifacts, funeral relics, and countless other mysterious objects steeped in dark history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you uncover the truth\u2026 or become part of the exhibit?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAME DURATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45-200 minutes</p>","developers":["Sine Coda"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629290/f205a4afa61cae61536e47552d6c0ee44efd029a/header.jpg?t=1774039908","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629290/406834023/631603a86f95fe5d625aabf24dba458b4a9ca363/1761031508/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761243357","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629290/406834023/631603a86f95fe5d625aabf24dba458b4a9ca363/1761031508/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761243357","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3629290/406834023/631603a86f95fe5d625aabf24dba458b4a9ca363/1761031508/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761243357","id":257220371,"name":"Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220371/4833e703f1fae62703804e